                </div>
                <div class="promotion-content">
                  <div class="text text-16">We promise transparent planning, responsive service,
                    and journeys built around what matters most to you. Whether you want a peaceful
                    cultural holiday, a honeymoon, a family escape, or a scenic road trip across
                    Bhutan, TripJyada works to make every detail smooth and well planned.</div>
